Kit to Clip is an agent skill that runs on top of other open-source tools. None of them is included in this
repository; the engine setup (setup/install.sh) downloads them on the user's machine:

- HyperFrames (HeyGen), Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes
- GSAP (GreenSock), GSAP Standard License: https://gsap.com/standard-license
- Node.js, ffmpeg (GPL build, for libx264), Python, NumPy, SciPy, OpenCV and fontTools, from conda-forge
- A headless Chrome build, downloaded by HyperFrames
